1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kapten Gustaf Örbom was born 25 Feb 1732/33 in Rödögården, Rödön, Jämtland, Sweden; died 15 Jun 1807 in Odensala, Brunflo, Jämtland, Sweden. He was the son of Kapten Anders Örbom (1675-1740) and Anna Elisabet von R
2 CONC ohr (1701-1767). He married Sophia Lovisa Winnberg (1744-1831) 25 Mar 1762 in Brunflo, Jämtland, Sweden.
