1 NAME Johan Claes /Fleming af Liebelitz/
2 GIVN Johan Claes
2 _MARNM Fleming af Liebelitz
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 AUG 1794
2 ADDR
3 CITY Turku
3 CTRY Finland
