2 CONT ===Titanic Passenger Summary===
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Mr Erik Gustaf Lind (Edward Lingrey)
2 CONT Titanic Victim
2 CONT Born: Friday 18th June 1869 in Gryt, Södermanland, Sweden 
2 CONT Age: 42 years 9 months and 27 days (Male)
2 CONT Nationality: Swedish
2 CONT Marital Status: Married to Elsa Teresia Dubois
2 CONT Last Residence: in Jordanstorp, Sweden
2 CONT Occupation: Businessman
2 CONT 1st Class Passengers
2 CONT Embarked: Southampton on Wednesday 10th April 1912
2 CONT Ticket No. 17475, £26 11s 
2 CONT Died in the Titanic disaster (15th April 1912)
2 CONT Body Not Identified
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Godsägare.
2 CONT
2 CONT Förlovning annonserad i SvD 10/5 1909
